<title>USA: Washington Real Estate files shelf offering.</title>
<headline>Washington Real Estate files shelf offering.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Washington Real Estate Investment Trust filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on Wednesday for a shelf offering of up to $200 million of debt securities, preferred shares, common shares and warrants to purchase common shares.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for general business purposes, including acquisition and/or renovation, expansion or improvement of income-producing properties or repayment of debt, the company said.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust did not name any underwriters for the offering.</p>
</text>
